From b8e70895928fd678e57671347a63016cd7f68c48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Suraj Gupta <suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jan 2025 22:45:00 -1200
Subject: [PATCH 092/110] net: axienet: Use XAXIENET_1_2p5G MAC type for AXI
 1G/2.5G ethernet

Use XAXIENET_1_2p5G instead of two diffenet MAC types for
AXI 1G/2.5G ethernet as AXI 2.5G is incremental speed upgrade
of AXI 1G ethernet.
Add phylink support for 2.5G ethernet MAC.
Dont warn if switch_x_sgmii is used without 1000base-x or
SGMII phy-mode as 2.5G MAC also supports 2500basex <-> SGMII
switching.

Co-developed-by: Harini Katakam <harini.katakam@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Harini Katakam <harini.katakam@amd.com>
Co-developed-by: John Linn <john.linn@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: John Linn <john.linn@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Suraj Gupta <suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Radhey Shyam Pandey <radhey.shyam.pandey@amd.com>
State: pending
Message-ID: <20250107104507.359136-23-suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
